  "sources": [
    "Carrier list: English Wikipedia 'Ben Gurion Airport' (section 'Airlines and destinations', current revision and the revision of 2023-09-14) and 'Ramon Airport' (current revision). Wikipedia text is CC BY-SA 4.0. The IAA flight board (iaa.gov.il) is the primary source those tables cite.",
