    "lowCost: true only when the carrier is listed in English Wikipedia 'List of low-cost airlines' (revision of 2026-09-29). Everything else is false, which means 'not listed there', not a statement about the fares of a given ticket.",
    "Sundor (El Al's leisure brand) sells under LY and has no own IATA code, so it is covered by the LY row."
